USERDEL(8)                 System Administration                  USERDEL(8)

NAME
    userdel - delete an account

SYNOPSIS
    userdel UID

DESCRIPTION
    Delete the account with user id UID. Its home directory and files are
    left where they are, still owned by the number UID.

SECURITY
    The administrator's session only. The kernel requires CAP_USER, which
    init lends the shell when the administrator logs in and takes back at
    logout.

SEE ALSO
    useradd(8)
